# Judge5-9-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Pensive_Open2,Mouth2_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:药肯定是<br>被【幕后黑手】<br>调包了。|#0105Trial09_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Pensive_Open2,Mouth2_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这样就能解释<br>为什么亚里沙小姐<br>会死于<br>【杀死魔女的药】了。|#0105Trial09_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……可、可是！<br>安眠药和毒药的颜色<br>不一样啊！<br>你是不可能<br>弄错的！<br>|#0105Trial09_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"这个的话，<br>有人让她服用了<br>除安眠药以外的<link=\"Objection_01_05_09_01\">其他药</link>……<br>我只好这么想了。|#0105Trial09_Meruru003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那奈叶香呢，<br>她的尸体不可能<br>出现在处刑台上……！<br>|#0105Trial09_Ema002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因为奈叶香今天早上<br>还在地下……！|#0105Trial09_Ema003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:今早有人<br>去过地下，<br>这一点典狱长已经<br>用处刑台的操作记录<br>作证过了！|#0105Trial09_Ema004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Pensive_Open2,Mouth2_Normal_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这个的话……<br>很遗憾，<br>我认为凶手应该是<br>艾玛小姐你。|#0105Trial09_Meruru004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR2-1,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果是我<br>在地下室<br>杀奈叶香的话，<br>我不可能<br>把她移动到<br>处刑台上啊！|#0105Trial09_Ema005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Pensive_Open2,Mouth2_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"很简单。<br>奈叶香小姐是<br>【<link=\"Objection_01_05_09_02\">前一天就被杀害了</link>】……<br>|#0105Trial09_Meruru005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Downcast_Open1,Mouth2_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我认为她是<br>在处刑台上被杀害，<br>然后直接被<br>移动到地下室了。|#0105Trial09_Meruru006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR2-1,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那时候<br>亚里沙应该在<br>审判庭里才对……！|#0105Trial09_Ema006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Normal_Open1,Mouth2_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……也就是说，<br>我认为<br>艾玛小姐<br><link=\"Objection_01_05_09_03\">同时</link>杀害了<br>亚里沙小姐<br>和奈叶香小姐。|#0105Trial09_Meruru007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Normal_Open2,Mouth2_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"你用<br><link=\"Objection_01_05_09_04\">杀死魔女的药</link><br>毒杀了亚里沙小姐……<br>并且用<br><link=\"Objection_01_05_09_05\">安眠药</link><br>让奈叶香小姐睡着了。|#0105Trial09_Meruru008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL8,Eyes2_Angry_Open1,Mouth2_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"之后，<br>艾玛小姐<br><link=\"Objection_01_05_09_06\">操作处刑台</link><br><link=\"Objection_01_05_09_07\">冻死</link>了奈叶香小姐。<br>只要是幕后黑手就可以<br>自由操作处刑台的机关……<br>|#0105Trial09_Meruru009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR4_2,ArmL4,Eyes2_Angry_Closed1,Mouth2_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而身为幕后黑手的凶手<br>就是你……！<br>樱羽艾玛小姐……！|#0105Trial09_Meruru010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR2-1,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:幕后黑手是你啊……！<br>冰上梅露露！|#0105Trial09_Ema007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR10,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这、这……<br>该怎么办啊……！|#0105Trial09_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只能靠自己的头脑<br>思考了。|#0105Trial09_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR13,ArmL9,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Comical_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"别说得这么轻松啊！<br>今天<br><link=\"Objection_01_05_09_08\">起床时就感觉糟透了</link>，<br>根本就莫名其妙！<br>|#0105Trial09_Coco002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……如果艾玛<br>是凶手的话，<br>奈叶香就是<br>【被迷晕后<br>从审判庭转移到地下的】……<br>|#0105Trial09_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果梅露露<br>是凶手的话，<br>奈叶香就是<br>【在地下被杀后<br>转移到了处刑台上】……|#0105Trial09_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"有没有能指出<br>奈叶香遇害地点的<br><br><link=\"Objection_01_05_09_09\">证据</link>呢？|#0105Trial09_Margo004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

